Relationship Summary
Parent Table	Child Table	Relationship
Students	Enrollments	One-to-Many
Courses	Enrollments	One-to-Many
Students	Grades	One-to-Many
Courses	Grades	One-to-Many
Students	Fee_Records	One-to-Many
Students	Documents	One-to-Many
Users	Audit_Log	One-to-Many
Notes
Enrollments is the junction table that resolves the many-to-many relationship between Students and Courses.
Grades stores assessment results for a specific student in a specific course.
Documents stores uploaded student documents.
Fee_Records manages financial transactions linked to students.
Audit_Log records actions performed by users for security and traceability.
Admission_Applications and Research_Papers are currently standalone entities based on your Week 1 roadmap.